   "polite": "onaka o kowashimasu",
   "english": "get an upset stomach",
   "ja": "お腹を壊す",
   "kana": "おなかをこわす",
   "politeJa": "お腹を壊します",
   "noun": "onaka",
   "particle": "o",
   "verb": "kowasu",
   "verbJa": "壊す",
   "verbSense": "break, damage (a thing); with the body, harm it",
   "englishVerb": "upset",
   "trap": "English 'have an upset stomach' gives no usable verb. Japanese 'breaks' the stomach with kowasu, transitive, with the speaker as subject: onaka kowashita.",
   "partners": [
