   "flags": [],
   "use": "The discreet everyday way to mention diarrhoea or a bad stomach, mostly past: onaka kowashita. Also a warning: sonna ni tabetara onaka kowasu yo. O often drops.",
   "notes": "Onaka no choushi ga warui is the vaguer, more discreet version; geri (diarrhoea) is the clinic word.",
